# Optional. The console is fully functional without it: both corpora, every
# verdict, the whole scorecard, the abstention grouping, the permalink, the CSV
# and POST /api/normalize all work with this unset. The key buys one thing only —
# reading the titles the engine abstained on and proposing lexicon entries, which
# land in the Abstentions pane as a copyable diff and are never written to disk.
#
# The model never normalizes a title and never appears in a measured number.
#
# Unset   -> POST /api/propose returns 501 and points at the lexicon.
# Invalid -> 502.
GEMINI_API_KEY=
